# go-agent

## Canonical docs (read in order)

1. `go-agent/docs/design.md` + `go-agent/docs/decisions.md` (`AG-D*`)
2. `go-agent/docs/workplan.md` (contract-spine P0–P5)
3. Wire stand-in: `go-agent/docs/p2-baseline.md` → `go-agent/docs/p2-wire-assumptions.md` (ASSUMED until backend `contracts/`)
4. Audit/dispositions: `go-agent/docs/p2-wire-assumptions-audit.md`
5. Persist/introspection: `go-agent/docs/p3-mechanism-gaps.md`
6. Implementation plan: `docs/plans/go-agent/001-host-local-vertical-slice.md` (**DRAFT** until APPROVED)
